  "solution": {
    "text": "Energy of an atom when n = 1<br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1312</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1312</mn><mtext> kJ mo</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>l</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/>Similarly energy when  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1312</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>145.7</mn><mtext> kJ mo</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>l</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/>The energy absorbed when an electron jumps from  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>  to  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>145.7</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1312</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1166.3</mn><mtext> kJ mo</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>l</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1166.3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6.023</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>193.6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>=